{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "11 synthetic callers. Every name, phone number and Aadhaar-style number is invented (the 12-digit number is not a valid Aadhaar). Callers are scripted: a move is used when its trigger matches what the agent just said, so the script branches on the reply. {placeholders} are filled per language by speech.fmt; dates are the first open days of the coming week, picked when the run starts.",
